description: Never put a personal email in commits, docs, or rules
alwaysApply: true
---

# No personal emails

Commits, co-author trailers, docs, and rules use a GitHub noreply address:

`ID+username@users.noreply.github.com`

The ID is the account's numeric GitHub id. Do not read an email out of `git log`, `git config`, or a profile and copy it into a commit. Do not invent or store a personal mailbox for an author.
